  {'url': 'https://polygon.gateway.tenderly.co', 'supports': 'eth_getLogs on the PoolManager for the ERC-6909 Transfer topic 0x1b3d7edb2e9c0b0e7c525b20aaaef0f5940d2ed71663c7d39266ecafac728859 with from zero and id sLGNS, blocks 66,980,384 to head: 661 logs, six recipients, 20,418.69 sLGNS, all in blocks where (97,813,512 minus block) is a multiple of 14,400. Same query for sATH: 150 logs, 328.86. For sKLIMA: 8 logs, 0.0102. Receipt of the traced transaction: mint of 9,015,568,747 base units, fee 3.389 POL. epoch() returned length 14,400, number 3019, endBlock 97,813,512, distribute 1,626,667.27 LGNS; circulatingSupply 6,840,830,136.40; balanceOf(PoolManager) 36,908.562773129.'},
  {'url': 'https://sourcify.dev/server/v2/contract/137/0x25d28a24ceb6f81015bb0b2007d795acac411b4d?fields=sources,abi,compilation', 'supports': 'KlimaStaking source with the same public rebase(). eth_call through Multicall3 at the latest block: sKLIMA balance of the PoolManager 247,670,486,325 before and 247,671,762,854 after rebase(); epoch() endBlock 83,607,730 with length 11,520 against head 97,800,242.'},
